    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://ekgf.org/ontology/file-system#> .

<https://ekgf.org/ontology/file-system#ArchiveFormat>
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://ekgf.org/ontology/file-system#> .

<https://ekgf.org/ontology/file-system#ArchiveMember>
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://ekgf.org/ontology/file-system#> .

<https://ekgf.org/ontology/file-system#ArchiveVersion>
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://ekgf.org/ontology/file-system#> .

<https://ekgf.org/ontology/file-system#Attachment>
